# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Material Design 3 Qt Quick app generated by **md3-create**, using the [QML_MD3]({{MD3_PATH_ABS}}) component library.

| | |
|--|--|
| Qt | {{QT_VERSION}} ({{QT_KIT}}) |
| QML URI | `{{QML_URI}}` |
| Template | `{{TEMPLATE}}` |
| Md3 path | `{{MD3_PATH}}` |

## Build

```bash
cmake --preset default
cmake --build build
```

Or with Qt Creator: open `CMakeLists.txt` and configure the matching kit.

## Run

```bash
./build/{{TARGET_NAME}}
```

## Theme

In QML:

```qml
Md3Theme.dark = true
Md3Theme.applySeed("{{SEED_COLOR}}")
```

When using a vendored prebuilt tree (`vendor/Md3`), docs live in the original QML_MD3 repo.
